#ASSERT `the Ma'of supplement after the balance` 300 450 EQUALS 0

-- (ח): what the section agrees does not lower an employee's salary from
-- what it was on the eve of the signing. (ט)(1): promoted, or given the
-- stay supplement, he has from that day the amount of his new grade, so
-- long as it is no higher than 10 / 40; ¶2: the example — 9+ at 120 in
-- October 2012, then 10 at 70; 10 at 70, then 11 at nothing. (2): the
-- change does not lower his salary from its eve. (3): part-time, pro rata.
@ref akn:art_4__para_h akn:art_4__para_i akn:art_4__para_i__subpara_1 akn:art_4__para_i__subpara_1/p2 akn:art_4__para_i__subpara_2 akn:art_4__para_i__subpara_3
