GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the Ma'of supplement for` g position IS
    CONSIDER `the Ma'of supplement's table amount for` g
    WHEN JUST a THEN a `pro rata to a position of` position
    WHEN NOTHING THEN 0

