-- minimum wage; (ז): a base of the 3.6% supplement and of the 2011
-- supplement, and of no other existing one.
@ref akn:art_5__para_d akn:art_5__para_e akn:art_5__para_f akn:art_5__para_g
GIVEN p IS A `what a supplement of 17.5.2012 counts for`
