-- (א): from 1.10.2012 a supplement of 10% of the combined salary to the
-- local authorities' employees in these roles: (1) a kindergarten
-- teacher's assistant, a substitute among them (§104 of the local
-- authorities' Work Constitution); (2) an assistant in organic classes
-- (§106.1); (3) a pedagogical assistant of severely autistic pupils and
-- pupils with mental disorders or severe retardation (§106.6); (4) the
-- (sole) assistant in a special-education kindergarten (§106.2); (5) an
-- educational assistant in the junior divisions (§106.5); (6) a
-- reinforcement assistant (notice 12/12) — each with the matching role in
-- the three large cities.
@ref akn:art_6__para_a akn:art_6__para_a__subpara_1 akn:art_6__para_a__subpara_2 akn:art_6__para_a__subpara_3 akn:art_6__para_a__subpara_4 akn:art_6__para_a__subpara_5 akn:art_6__para_a__subpara_6
DECLARE `role of 17.5.2012` IS ONE OF
    `a kindergarten teacher's assistant, of 17.5.2012`
    `an assistant in organic classes, of 17.5.2012`
    `a pedagogical assistant of severely disabled pupils, of 17.5.2012`
    `the assistant in a special-education kindergarten, of 17.5.2012`
    `an educational assistant in the junior divisions, of 17.5.2012`
    `a reinforcement assistant, of 17.5.2012`
    `another role, of 17.5.2012`

`the assistants' supplement rate` MEANS 10%

-- (ב)(1): the supplement is tied to the role and paid while he holds it.
GIVEN r IS A `role of 17.5.2012`, `his combined salary` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the assistants' supplement for` r `his combined salary` IS
