§§ `7 תוספת ניהול`

-- (א): from 1.10.2012 a management supplement to the new employees (as the
-- local supplements agreement of 3.3.99 defines them) who fill a
-- management role; (ב): three levels — 5%, 7.5% and 10% of the combined
-- salary.
