GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `industrial peace of 17.5.2012 binds on the other matters on` d IF
    d `is on or before` `industrial peace over the other matters of 17.5.2012 ends on`

-- (ט): 0.075% is taken off the next framework's frame (after 31.12.2012)
-- for these employees.
@ref akn:art_9__para_i
`taken off the next frame for these employees` MEANS 0.075%

§§ `10 ועדת מעקב`

-- (א): a committee of the Centre's or the three cities' representative and
-- the Histadrut's follows the agreement and decides its disputes
-- unanimously; (ב): failing agreement, a discussion with the parties and
-- the wages commissioner; (ג): failing a decision, either party may go to
-- the courts, or to another body if the committee and the parties agree.
@ref akn:art_10__para_a akn:art_10__para_b akn:art_10__para_c
`following the agreement of 17.5.2012` MEANS
    PARTY `the follow-up committee`
    MUST  `follow the agreement of 17.5.2012 and decide its disputes unanimously`
    LEST  (PARTY `the wages commissioner`
           MUST  `discuss an undecided dispute of 17.5.2012 with the wages commissioner`
           LEST  (PARTY `the employer`
                  MAY   `go to the courts over an undecided dispute of 17.5.2012`))
